-<head>
-<title>CSS selectors (classes and IDs) cannot start with a dash or with a digit</title>
-
-<style type="text/css">
-#divWrapper1 {color: green; background-color: white;}
-#1stSentence {color: red; background-color: white;}
-
-#divWrapper2 {color: green; background-color: white;}
-#-secondSentence {color: red; background-color: white; }
-
-h3 {color: green; background-color: white;}
-.3rdSentence {color: red; background-color: white;}
-
-h4 {color: green; background-color: white;}
-.-fourthSentence {color: red; background-color: white;}
